   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Layout only, no colors. Layout B chosen, refined (v3): the level screen at 1280 × 720 (the smallest window).\nFirst row: where to put the breadcrumb (v4), three variants to compare. Below: the screen paused, on the first visit, then with each menu open.\nThe large screen (1920 × 1080) comes once this layout is agreed. Double-click a block to edit it, Ctrl+Shift+G to ungroup.",
