   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A menu bar in the header, as in an IDE: Level, Edit, Run, Help. The goal opens in a bubble; the controls float as three squares\nin the corner of the code, pale while typing; the status bar holds the state, the steps, the speed and the position.\nThe variants of the map are pills in its corner (hidden when the level has one map); console and variables share tabs.",
   "originalText": "A menu bar in the header, as in an IDE: Level, Edit, Run, Help. The goal opens in a bubble; the controls float as three squares\nin the corner of the code, pale while typing; the status bar holds the state, the steps, the speed and the position.\nThe variants of the map are pills in its corner (hidden when the level has one map); console and variables share tabs.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
